5920799144", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974821_775155924132477_2564008038609215012_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-9zB7EToLi0Q7kNvwHVg89J&_nc_oc=AdqDuFLGCoNUI7DcHNA7q1AgiAU1SYXERdu69lEDQtGCzgUMJRAoZ2dI5r-4st7rsn8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLOsDl8W2zh6yMigLmA6FgE2x7w-3rhpBNSpwrKavqN4g&oe=6ABE61F7"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Image 2560x1440.png", "id": "312906721803281", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75500286_312906725136614_1043827207362831468_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KQuKLV3lWpMQ7kNvwHE99Zg&_nc_oc=AdrJSC-PC8pqg3whQidytWR9Pk6lb7a4ph9c5WBim2Ljfh8sZ-pv5nC1QxYT7qMo270&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKfOUws6L2FEjEK3YcUy1Zpc3P5wyA64HHbo2p_QL09KA&oe=6ABE88AB"}, "display_name": "Contractors Showdown", "keywords": ["BR", "FPS", "BattleRoyale", "military", "simulation"], "long_description": "Contractors Showdown delivers an immersive military-styled VR First-Person Shooter experience. Engage in heart-pounding combat as you, along with 59 other players, navigate a vast and detailed 16 square-kilometer map. The game centers around a thrilling Battle Royale game mode, where strategic prowess and combat skills are paramount.  Gear up for intense battles, dynamic team play, and a visually stunning VR environment that thrusts players into the forefront of military actions.", "short_description": "Contractors Showdown delivers an immersive military-styled VR First-Person Shooter experience that centers around a thrilling Battle Royale game mode, where strategic prowess and combat skills are paramount."}]}, "developer_name": "Caveman Game Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.contractorsvr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Caveman Game Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.cont