6400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1372692061051293"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26761673876863867", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "247209914665124", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26761673876863867"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "Release332 - game version 1.7.0.1\n\nPatch 1.7.0.1 / Release 332\n\nFixed missing inventory ledger entries after successful barter exchanges.\nFixed incorrect item counts during expired-item returns and the resulting HQ reload loops.\nFixed inconsistent M1897 ammunition counts between storage and Gunsmith caches.\nAdded protection against missing Scav/AI body meshes, including a fallback model.\nFixed incorrect localization of task objectives such as \u201cFind the Missing Scholar.\u201d\nFixed an issue allowing the entire ASH-12 to be placed in magazine pouches.\nAdded the missing sidearm holster compatibility tag to the GP100.\nAdded Scav/PMC task isolation logic", "created_date": 1790348930, "id": "26761673876863867", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 332, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26761616950202893"}, "asset_files": {"count": 36}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26761673876863867"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "Patch Notes\n\n## New Weapons and Attachments\n\nAdded four weapons and their associated attachments:\n\n* GP100 9\u00d719mm revolver\n* ASH-12 12.7\u00d755mm assault rifle\n* MX338\n* SESA2\n\nAdded the following attachments:\n\n* RC416 SMR handguard: black without rails and tan with rails\n* AR NightRail handguard\n* AR SCS stock\n* AK 1U020 handguard: tan and black variants\n* AK KEK stock\n\n## Map Updates\n\n* Reworked the Leopard base at the Dam Factory.\n* Reworked the Suburb Military Camp.\n* Reworked the interior of the Suburb Shopping Mall.\n* Improved the layout of northern Suburb.\n* Expanded the northwestern area of Suburb.\n* Improved performance at the Factory and Shopping Mall.\n* Improved indoor audio across many buildings in Suburb and Dam.\n* Fixed various map-related issues.\n\n## Tasks and Trader Progression\n\n* Reorganized task order and prerequisite requirements. Trader progression now advances across multiple traders and includes level requirements. The available XP is sufficient to meet those requirements.\n* Adjusted trader upgrade timing and task milestones so players can no longer progress by focusing on a single trader.\n* Reduced the required quantities for some tasks.\n* Revised many task descriptions to make locations and objectives clearer.\n\n## HQ Progression\n\n* Reduced the materials required for HQ upgrades.\n* Increased the benefits of some upgrades. Higher level recovery upgrades now work faster, and some higher level in-raid bonuses have been slightly increased.\n* Revised HQ upgrade prerequisites to require more gradual progression.\n\n## Combat Balance\n\n* Rebalanced bullet blunt damage. Some low penetration rounds now deal substantially more blunt damage, while some high tier rounds receive a smaller increase.\n* Adjusted the body armor penetration curve. The penetration threshold has changed from a one-tier difference to a 1.5-tier difference, while the chance of lower tier rounds penetrating has increased slightly. This change applies to body armor only.\n* High tier body armor now loses more durability when absorbing blunt damage.\n\n## Audio\n\n* Fixed an issue that prevented the tail of unsuppressed gunshots from playing.\n* Created new unsuppressed and suppressed firing sounds for the M4A1/AR15 and M16.\n* Adjusted the suppressed firing sound of the SECA 17SSR.\n\n## AI\n\n* AI enemies are less likely to actively search for players.\n* AI enemies are less likely to fire while moving at high speed.\n* AI enemies can now use the ASH-12 12.7\u00d755mm assault rifle and GP100 9\u00d719mm revolver.\n\n## Medical Items\n\n* Reduced the use time of buff injections from 5 seconds to 1.5 seconds.\n\n## Rebirth and the Rebirth Shop\n\nPvE players above level 20 can now use Rebirth to reset their PvE account progression.\n\n* Stash assets are converted into Rebirth Tokens at a rate of **10,000 in asset value per token**, up to a maximum of **10,000 tokens**.\n* Rebirth clears all PvE account data, including the stash. DLC rewards must be claimed again afterward.\n* Rebirth Tokens can be spent in the PvE Rebirth Shop on existing top tier ammunition, armor, weapons, and backpacks.\n* The shop also offers PvE-exclusive enhanced items, including double-capacity magazines and medical items, faster healing limb repair kits, level 8 armor, high-damage grenades, and grips that greatly reduce recoil.\n\n## Performance and Stability\n\n* Improved performance and client stability.\n* Added further anti-cheat measures.\n\n## Bug Fixes\n\n* Fixed an issue that prevented dropped weapons from rendering completely.\n* Fixed ragdoll behavior that caused enemy bodies to collapse into a pile.\n* Fixed incorrect recoil calculations when firing one-handed.", "created_date": 1790195036, "id": "26738906035807318", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 331, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26738881845809737"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26761673876863867"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1789975674, "id": "26702298632801392", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 330, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26702278719470050"}, "asset_files": {"count": 24}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26761673876863867"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.6.16.0", "created_date": 1788429750, "id": "26468174169547174", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 325, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26468158416215416"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "4963431797114722", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "26761673876863867"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "247209914665124"}]}, "change_log": "v.1.6.15.0", "created_date": 1785384398, "id": "26044009601963635", "version": "1.0", "version_code": 324, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "26043938105304118"}, "asset_files": {"count": 5}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}